<title>USA: Philip Morris may issue $500 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Philip Morris may issue $500 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philip Morris Cos Inc is expected to price $500 million in five-year debt via Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc, market sources said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to price as early as this week; however, no further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
